# Fix web UI calling localhost:8080 (CORS OPTIONS 403)

- **Timestamp:** 2026-07-24 21:22 +03:30
- **Host:** t3-new
- **Symptom:** Browser on https://dogan.xaigrok.ir/ called `http://localhost:8080/dogan/api/v1/auth/login` (OPTIONS 403)

## Cause

`parkiroid-web:latest` was built with default `VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/dogan/api/v1`. Production API CORS is fine (`https://dogan.xaigrok.ir` allowed; OPTIONS → 204).

## Fix applied

Patched live asset in `dogan-webui`:

`http://localhost:8080/dogan/api/v1` → `https://dogan-api.xaigrok.ir/dogan/api/v1`

in `/usr/share/nginx/html/assets/index-ejEv6ibH.js`, then `nginx -s reload`.

## Follow-up

Rebuild `parkiroid-web` with:

`VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://dogan-api.xaigrok.ir/dogan/api/v1`

or the patch is lost on image recreate.
